cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this paper or the standards dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Việt Nam như cầu nối trong nền kinh tế AI2AI: Tài liệu thảo luận mở về tầng giao thức liên vận"
abstract: >-
  An open discussion paper on whether Vietnam can play a sustainable, genuinely
  valuable role in the global AI value chain without competing to build
  billion-dollar foundation models. Proposes testing a neutral AI reference
  bridge layer between fragmented AI ecosystems, and closes with twelve open
  questions for the community plus a published stopping criterion. Accompanied
  by a machine-readable dataset of 22 international AI interoperability and
  AI-governance instruments.
type: software
